ce makes the database claim the root cause. This implies the candidate has accepted the on-call consensus as sufficient evidence without verifying the claim's validity.", "evidence": "E2", "first_seen_iteration": 0, "id": "W002", "last_seen_iteration": 0, "occurrences": 2, "severity": "high", "status": "open", "status_reason": "Rediscovered by critique", "target_id": "certainty of root cause", "type": "CANDIDATE_INTERNAL"}]}

